# Lock files
# uv.lock IS tracked as of 2026-08-03. The previous "ignore all lock files"
# policy contradicted the rest of the repo: CI ran an unpinned
# `uv sync --all-extras`, so any upstream release could redden the build with no
# repo change, while Dockerfile.test did `COPY pyproject.toml uv.lock` +
# `uv sync --locked` — meaning the documented full-suite path
# (scripts/test-docker.sh, see CLAUDE.md) could not build from a clean clone at all.
poetry.lock

